  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3514.01 Title V Operating Permits",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3514.01 Title V Operating Permits. Any facility that contains a HMIWI unit subject to the provisions of this chapter shall be subject to the permitting requirements of Env-A 609.\n\nSource. #6938, eff 1-30-99; ss by #8788, eff 1-5-07\n\nAppendix",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a3500.html"
